# Declared exemptions for the call-valued-index check.
#
# Format: file | fingerprint | reason
#   fingerprint — the normalized `base[index]` as the check extracts it,
#                 placeholders ({s}, {d}) included.
#   reason      — why this call-in-index cannot force the copy (mandatory).
#                 An entry matching no site fails the check.
#
# Empty today on purpose: every site the check flags is the defect shape,
# and the fix (bind the call's result to a const, then index) is uniformly
# correct — prefer converting a site over exempting it.
